---
layout: base.njk
title: 도입 사례
---
<section class="gradient-hero grid-overlay relative pt-20 pb-16 md:pt-24 md:pb-20">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
    <p class="text-sm font-bold text-techblue-300 tracking-wider mb-3">USE CASES</p>
    <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white leading-snug">도입 전후로 증명된 변화</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">디씨테크 솔루션을 도입한 산업 현장에서 기대할 수 있는 개선 효과를 사례로 확인해 보세요.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-slate-50">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      {% for item in collections.cases %}
      <a href="{{ item.url }}" class="card-hover block bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
        <div class="p-8">
          <span class="inline-block text-xs font-bold text-techblue-500 bg-techblue-50 rounded-full px-3 py-1 mb-4">{{ item.data.tag }}</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy-900 mb-3">{{ item.data.title }}</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">{{ item.data.summary }}</p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-6 border-t border-slate-100">
            {% for b in item.data.after %}
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-1">{{ b.label }}</p>
              <p class="text-lg font-bold text-techblue-500">{{ b.value }}</p>
            </div>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-techblue-500 mt-6">
            자세히 보기
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </span>
        </div>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 text-center mt-6">* 상기 사례는 도입 효과를 설명하기 위한 예시이며, 실제 결과는 설비 환경에 따라 달라질 수 있습니다.</p>
  </div>
</section>
